  "en": "So then, what'll it be?"
 },
 {
  "id": "fd07_29:007:00",
  "speaker": "購買のおばちゃん",
  "jp": "はい、ありがとね。\nまたおいでや～。",
  "en": "Okay, thank ya. Come agaaain~"
 },
